## Overview
Elastic Net regression model to predict abalone age from morphological measurements. Conducted repeated 10-fold cross-validation with MAE as the evaluation metric.

## Technologies
- R, Caret, Elastic Net, Machine Learning
- Data preprocessing and feature engineering
- Cross-validation and hyperparameter tuning

## Results
Trained elastic net model on abalone dataset with optimal hyperparameters (α = 0.5, λ tuned via CV).

